WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.400
-Welcome back, everybody!
We're talking to

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.701
the one and only Javier Bardem,

00:00:03.701 --> 00:00:07.334
who stars
in "Being the Ricardos."

00:00:07.334 --> 00:00:08.834
I want to get into that.

00:00:08.834 --> 00:00:11.133
I really want to talk about
this, "Being the Ricardos."

00:00:11.133 --> 00:00:13.634
But before we talk about that,
I want to say congratulations,

00:00:13.634 --> 00:00:16.133
because you also star
in a new movie from Spain,

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:18.834
called "The Good Boss."
-Yes.

00:00:18.834 --> 00:00:22.033
-Which received, I want to say,
a record-breaking 20 nominations

00:00:22.033 --> 00:00:24.133
for Spain's equivalent
of the Oscars.

00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:27.534
And it's Spain's entry for
the International Film Oscar.

00:00:27.534 --> 00:00:30.367
Congratulations on that.
That's unbelievable.

00:00:30.367 --> 00:00:33.634
-Thank you very much.
I'm -- I'm very happy to --

00:00:33.634 --> 00:00:36.167
representing my country
with this amazing --

00:00:36.167 --> 00:00:37.234
this amazing movie.

00:00:37.234 --> 00:00:38.901
Let's see where it gets.
-Yeah.

00:00:38.901 --> 00:00:41.968
But "Being the Ricardos,"
I'm watching this,

00:00:41.968 --> 00:00:45.033
because I'm a fan, obviously,
of Lucille Ball, "I Love Lucy."

00:00:45.033 --> 00:00:47.334
And I go, "Okay.
I just want to see, you know,

00:00:47.334 --> 00:00:49.367
hopefully, Nicole nails --"

00:00:49.367 --> 00:00:50.968
I don't know if she's gonna
do an impression or what.

00:00:50.968 --> 00:00:52.968
She didn't.
She just is Lucille.

00:00:52.968 --> 00:00:54.701
She's amazing.
It's not an impression.

00:00:54.701 --> 00:00:56.501
It's just amazing acting.

00:00:56.501 --> 00:00:59.767
And then you come in
and knock it out of the park

00:00:59.767 --> 00:01:01.467
as Desi Arnaz.
-Thank you.

00:01:01.467 --> 00:01:03.901
-I'm -- I've seen every episode.
I know the way he acts,

00:01:03.901 --> 00:01:05.901
the way he talks,
the way he sings.

00:01:05.901 --> 00:01:09.667
I mean, did you know how to play
congas and guitar and sing?

00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:12.000
And...?
-No, of course not.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.801
I didn't know anything.
But I -- I lied.

00:01:13.801 --> 00:01:15.868
And I said to the director
I knew how to do everything.

00:01:15.868 --> 00:01:18.701
[ Laughter ]
And -- as every actor should do.

00:01:18.701 --> 00:01:22.634
We first lie, get the contract,
get -- get us signed.

00:01:22.634 --> 00:01:26.033
And once we are signed, then we
cope with the consequences.

00:01:26.033 --> 00:01:27.701
[ Laughter ]
That's what happened.

00:01:27.701 --> 00:01:29.501
-I mean --
-The good thing is that Aaron,

00:01:29.501 --> 00:01:32.067
through zoom, he knew
exactly that I was lying

00:01:32.067 --> 00:01:33.434
when he asked me, "Do you sing?"
"Of course."

00:01:33.434 --> 00:01:34.567
"Do you play guitar?"

00:01:34.567 --> 00:01:36.033
"Oh, my God.
I was born with a guitar."

00:01:36.033 --> 00:01:37.834
"Do you play congas?"
"Congas? I have one here.

00:01:37.834 --> 00:01:39.901
Do you want to hear it?"
"Do you dance?"

00:01:39.901 --> 00:01:41.801
"Dance?
Jesus, stop me.

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:43.400
I can't -- I can't
stop dancing all day long."

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:44.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.567 --> 00:01:45.767
"Do you speak
with a Cuban accent?"

00:01:45.767 --> 00:01:46.801
"Anytime."
-That is very convincing.

00:01:46.801 --> 00:01:47.901
-"You speak
with an English accent?"

00:01:47.901 --> 00:01:49.667
"Oh, yeah.
I speak English perfectly."

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:54.234
And then, his glasses were
like -- like, steaming up.

00:01:54.234 --> 00:01:55.300
-Oh, really?
Aaron's?

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:57.434
-Like, the steam
was going out and saying,

00:01:57.434 --> 00:01:59.400
"Jesus, he's such a liar."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:02.701
But she was so nice
to really go with the lie...

00:02:02.701 --> 00:02:04.801
-Yeah.
-...and give me a chance.

00:02:04.801 --> 00:02:06.400
-It turned out so great.

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:09.934
What a good gamble on a lie.
And, man, you were just

00:02:09.934 --> 00:02:12.801
so convincing,
and it was just -- it was --

00:02:12.801 --> 00:02:16.634
It's beautiful.
It's -- I don't know.

00:02:16.634 --> 00:02:19.000
How would you describe
"Being the Ricardos"?

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.934
-It's the story about
two great geniuses of comedy,

00:02:21.934 --> 00:02:25.901
genius that really created
a different world and shaped

00:02:25.901 --> 00:02:29.567
the world of comedy
and TV comedy, TV programs,

00:02:29.567 --> 00:02:31.567
comedy programs
as we know today.

00:02:31.567 --> 00:02:35.534
And also, the love story
between a woman and a man

00:02:35.534 --> 00:02:38.267
and how much they have to cope
with one another

00:02:38.267 --> 00:02:42.234
and trust each other
and really try to make it.

00:02:42.234 --> 00:02:43.567
-Yeah.
-To make it through.

00:02:43.567 --> 00:02:45.868
-I want to show everyone a clip.
You're fantastic in it.

00:02:45.868 --> 00:02:47.934
Here's Javier Bardem
as Desi Arnaz

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:50.234
in "Being the Ricardos."
Take a look.

00:02:50.234 --> 00:02:55.334
♪♪

00:02:55.334 --> 00:02:57.067
-♪ Olé, olé, olé olé ♪

00:02:57.133 --> 00:02:58.734
-♪ Olé, olé, olé olé ♪

00:02:58.801 --> 00:03:00.400
-♪ Olé, olé, olé olé ♪

00:03:00.467 --> 00:03:02.334
-♪ Olé, olé, olé olé ♪

00:03:02.334 --> 00:03:04.067
-♪ Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah ♪

00:03:04.067 --> 00:03:05.567
-♪ Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah ♪

00:03:05.567 --> 00:03:11.300
♪♪

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:14.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:14.067 --> 00:03:21.901
♪♪

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:23.434
-Yes!

00:03:23.434 --> 00:03:26.000
That's exactly right!
Yes!

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.734
Javier Bardem, everybody!

00:03:27.734 --> 00:03:31.300
"Being the Ricardos" is in
theaters and on Prime Video.

